Bit 2 = Process Data Length Err
Bit 7 = K-Bus invalid
Bit 8 = No valid Inputs
Bit 9 = K-Bus Input Update busy
Bit 10 = K-Bus Output Update busy
Bit 11 = Watchdog Err
Bit 15 = Acyc. Function atcive (e.g. K-Bus Reset)
]]></Comment>
